  "description": "Some doors should stay closed. \n\nJaeho is a genius but receives little recognition. He opens a clothing store, unaware that the building he rents is hiding a secret portal to another world! One day a man emerges, speaking in tongues. How does he know Jaeho’s name? Where is he from? Most importantly, what does he want with Jaeho? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
